<node id="Tactical Level Of Warfare">
  <data key="d0">Tactical Level Of Warfare</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">The tactical level of warfare is the level at which battles and engagements are planned and executed to achieve military objectives.</data>
