<node id="ATP 3-06.1/MCRP 3-20.4/NTTP 3-01.04/AFTTP 3-2.29">
  <data key="d0">ATP 3-06.1/MCRP 3-20.4/NTTP 3-01.04/AFTTP 3-2.29</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">This document is a joint publication dated 22 FEB 2022 containing guidelines on UAS categorization and operational planning.&lt;SEP&gt;A military publication dated 22 FEB 2022 providing guidance on urban operations and aviation considerations.&lt;SEP&gt;A military publication dated 22 FEB 2022 containing guidelines on urban operations, grid systems, and flight techniques.&lt;SEP&gt;Military manual doctrine published on 22 FEB 2022 containing guidelines for urban operations.&lt;SEP&gt;ATP 3-06.1/MCRP 3-20.4/NTTP 3-01.04/AFTTP 3-2.29 is a military manual dated 22 FEB 2022 providing guidance on urban operations, navigation, and landing zone considerations.&lt;SEP&gt;This document contains guidelines on environmental and night considerations for aircraft operations.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c0e9849c17fc43c6ff4116d537e8d8ae&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9003ffcb1e412e2a2979f93305f0e476&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-255d2259beb766bee7c72c77afa91c9c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-92727f2c37c01b0f00dced1121d6f6ba&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f85140b13c2f4467aec323c7ad488b32&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bf2865a0fcb23cc7955b08ca1d4c5b89</data>
