<node id="Aircrews">
  <data key="d0">Aircrews</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Personnel who must establish communications with ground maneuver elements.&lt;SEP&gt;Aircrews are personnel who should establish communications with ground elements and controlling agencies.&lt;SEP&gt;Aircrews are assisted by products like satellite imagery to minimize unknowns and visualize objective areas.&lt;SEP&gt;Personnel operating aircraft who must account for hazards and use specific insertion techniques.&lt;SEP&gt;Aircrews are personnel who maintain orientation using linear features and navigational systems.</data>
