  <data key="d2">The Aircrew provides input to produce relevant aviation maps and charts before mission execution.&lt;SEP&gt;Personnel who receive target handovers and transition to reference systems used by ground elements upon arrival.&lt;SEP&gt;Aircrew use NVDs and must discern light sources during night formation tactics.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-9003ffcb1e412e2a2979f93305f0e476&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-92727f2c37c01b0f00dced1121d6f6ba&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f85140b13c2f4467aec323c7ad488b32</data>
