  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Small arms are a predominant threat to aviation assets in urban environments, emplaced in supersurface locations.&lt;SEP&gt;Small Arms are weapons easily concealed and operated from multiple urban vantage points.&lt;SEP&gt;Weapons that pose a risk to aircrews, mitigated by high flight profiles.&lt;SEP&gt;Weapons used by the entrenched Rangers to halt enemy attacks.</data>
