  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">A rooftop insertion and extraction technique preferred for the evacuation of civilians.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-255d2259beb766bee7c72c77afa91c9c</data>
  <data key="d4">D:\Academic resources\ARN34839-ATP_3-06.1-000-WEB-1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778752901</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Civilians">
  <data key="d0">Civilians</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Individuals who may require evacuation using hoist operations during rooftop insertion and extraction.&lt;SEP&gt;Civilians are at risk of injury near Drop Zones if not properly controlled.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-255d2259beb766bee7c72c77afa91c9c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bf2865a0fcb23cc7955b08ca1d4c5b89</data>
