<node id="Fixed-Wing Aircraft">
  <data key="d0">Fixed-Wing Aircraft</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Fixed-wing aircraft are part of the high volume of air traffic within urban areas.&lt;SEP&gt;Fixed-wing aircraft are involved in FARP and ADGR operations and marshalling plans.&lt;SEP&gt;A type of aircraft requiring marshalling plans at FARP and ADGR sites.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-255d2259beb766bee7c72c77afa91c9c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-466f239ae26f543930ce42fb131832cc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-92727f2c37c01b0f00dced1121d6f6ba</data>
