  <data key="d0">Tiltrotor Aircraft</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Tiltrotor aircraft are involved in FARP and ADGR operations and marshalling plans.&lt;SEP&gt;A type of aircraft requiring marshalling plans at FARP and ADGR sites.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-255d2259beb766bee7c72c77afa91c9c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-92727f2c37c01b0f00dced1121d6f6ba</data>
