</node>
<node id="Rules Of Engagement">
  <data key="d0">Rules Of Engagement</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">ROE is a key understanding requirement for mission planning and is influenced by political, social, and cultural considerations.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-466f239ae26f543930ce42fb131832cc</data>
