  <data key="d0">SUAS</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Small Unmanned Aircraft Systems are used by friendly ground forces and present air hazards requiring integration into airspace control.&lt;SEP&gt;SUAS are Small Unmanned Aircraft Systems recognized as group 1 and 2 unmanned aircraft.</data>
