</node>
<node id="Urban Areas">
  <data key="d0">Urban Areas</data>
  <data key="d1">location</data>
  <data key="d2">Urban Areas are environments where ground maneuver elements use terrain-based reference systems.&lt;SEP&gt;Urban areas have higher temperatures and structures that affect wind patterns and IR signatures.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-92727f2c37c01b0f00dced1121d6f6ba&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f85140b13c2f4467aec323c7ad488b32</data>
