  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="CAS">
  <data key="d0">CAS</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">CAS is a close air support event that may occur simultaneously with MEDEVAC in the same airspace.&lt;SEP&gt;CAS (Close Air Support) is a military operation type affected by weather conditions as discussed in JP 3-09.3.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-92727f2c37c01b0f00dced1121d6f6ba&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b3a8a845280b83251233809b74dd7287</data>
