<node id="Hill 205">
  <data key="d0">Hill 205</data>
  <data key="d1">location</data>
  <data key="d2">Hill 205 was a defensive position captured by Rangers assigned to a tank company.&lt;SEP&gt;Hill 205 is the location where the Rangers fought from foxholes and were eventually overwhelmed by the enemy.</data>
