  <data key="d0">10 USC 167</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">10 USC 167 is a section of the United States Code that identifies assigned special operations activities and options for directed activities.&lt;SEP&gt;10 USC 167 is a United States Code section defining special operations duties.</data>
