  <data key="d0">Weapons Of Mass Destruction</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Weapons of mass destruction are artifacts whose conceptualization, development, possession, proliferation, use, and effects are countered by U.S. efforts.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-fe9b99ab479688bf15c5eb6b71313a3b</data>
