  <data key="d0">Countering Weapons Of Mass Destruction</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Countering weapons of mass destruction is a method involving efforts against actors to curtail weapons of mass destruction, led by USSOCOM.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-fe9b99ab479688bf15c5eb6b71313a3b</data>
