  <data key="d0">Mission Partners</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">Mission partners are entities with whom U.S. military forces must closely coordinate activities during unconventional warfare.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-fe9b99ab479688bf15c5eb6b71313a3b</data>
