  <data key="d0">Weapons of Mass Destruction</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Weapons of mass destruction are artifacts posing threats, targeted by defeat operations to deny possession and prevent transfer or employment.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c8f143cf228a70fcc3b24d3886031aa2</data>
  <data key="d4">D:\Academic resources\ARN44116-FM_3-05-000-WEB-1.pdf</data>
