  <data key="d0">Counter Threat Finance</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Counter threat finance is a directed special operations activity and a designated skill for USASOC.&lt;SEP&gt;Counter threat finance is a military activity providing offensive tools to deny, disrupt, destroy, or defeat financial infrastructure funding threats.</data>
