  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Operational preparation of the environment is a directed special operations activity.&lt;SEP&gt;Operational preparation of the environment involves actions to set conditions for mission execution in likely or potential operational areas.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c8f143cf228a70fcc3b24d3886031aa2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-83b849ddc9c6eed87498b4d0cd5715fc</data>
