  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Countering weapons of mass destruction is a directed special operations activity.&lt;SEP&gt;Countering Weapons of Mass Destruction is a strategic effort involving a range of activities to neutralize threats and support national security objectives.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c8f143cf228a70fcc3b24d3886031aa2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-83b849ddc9c6eed87498b4d0cd5715fc</data>
