  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">The Department of Defense Strategy for Countering Weapons of Mass Destruction provides guidance on activities associated with countering weapons of mass destruction.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c8f143cf228a70fcc3b24d3886031aa2</data>
