  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Direct Action Operations are conducted in limited access areas as part of the range of activities to counter weapons of mass destruction.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c8f143cf228a70fcc3b24d3886031aa2</data>
  <data key="d4">D:\Academic resources\ARN44116-FM_3-05-000-WEB-1.pdf</data>
