</node>
<node id="Counterterrorism Operations">
  <data key="d0">Counterterrorism Operations</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Counterterrorism Operations are conducted as part of the range of activities to counter weapons of mass destruction.</data>
