<node id="Partnership">
  <data key="d0">Partnership</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Partnership is a principle enabling the force to conduct missions and operate with or through partner forces and populations.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-9b8ed0cc5c4a8e919c8f12065962561e</data>
