<node id="Multidomain Operations">
  <data key="d0">Multidomain Operations</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Multidomain Operations represent the evolving complexities of the contemporary battlefield addressed by Army imperatives.&lt;SEP&gt;Multidomain Operations is a framework whose imperatives are essential considerations for the planning, preparation, execution, and assessment of operations.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-9b8ed0cc5c4a8e919c8f12065962561e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3dc5bd4d34c1ec405578b6459e4d25c4</data>
